  "body": "In WebDrive BiDi, there is a concept of [user context](https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#user-context), which is similar to CDP's [BrowserContext](https://chromedevtools.github.io/devtools-protocol/tot/Target/#method-createBrowserContext), which, in turn, is similar to Chrome's incognito profile. \r\n\r\nShould Bluetooth Simulation be a BrowserContext-specific, or it should be shared between all the BrowserContexts?\r\n\r\nRelated issue: https://github.com/WebBluetoothCG/web-bluetooth/issues/635\r\n",
